@startuml
[*] --> Received
Received --> BasicSupport : handle(request) on chain head
BasicSupport --> Handled : type == BASIC
BasicSupport --> TechnicalSupport : else super.handle(request)
TechnicalSupport --> Handled : type == TECHNICAL
TechnicalSupport --> BillingSupport : else super.handle(request)
BillingSupport --> Handled : type == BILLING
BillingSupport --> NoHandler : else nextHandler == null
Handled --> [*]
NoHandler --> [*]
note right of NoHandler
  BaseHandler.handle prints
  "No handler available for this request"
end note
@enduml
